(4669823, 666401, 39427, '<td valign="top">At first glance I was unimpressed, possibly due to the sheer amount of pics in a free study it takes a lot to catch your eye, but then i turned back and took this photo in... composition is spot on, with interesting elements found in the rule of 3rds intersections, as well as the even 3 horizontal layers of sky, background, foreground stacked so perfectly.  Tones are great and smooth, nice view, bumping to a 9 from the original 7</td>', 'At first glance I was unimpressed, possibly due to the sheer amount of pics in a free study it takes a lot to catch your eye, but then i turned back and took this photo in... composition is spot on, with interesting elements found in the rule of 3rds intersections, as well as the even 3 horizontal layers of sky, background, foreground stacked so perfectly.  Tones are great and smooth, nice view, bumping to a 9 from the original 7', '2008-05-01 02:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
