(4670985, 673140, 47169, '<td valign="top">I must confess my complete lack of knowledge on the topic of this shot, so I don''t know if the chalk/cloud has any relevance to dance (im thinking in terms of grip/stability), but I think it adds so much to an already incredible shot. Your choice of side lighting works so well here, you certainly captured the perfect moment! Well done.</td>', 'I must confess my complete lack of knowledge on the topic of this shot, so I don''t know if the chalk/cloud has any relevance to dance (im thinking in terms of grip/stability), but I think it adds so much to an already incredible shot. Your choice of side lighting works so well here, you certainly captured the perfect moment! Well done.', '2008-05-01 11:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
