(4671472, 667841, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think the boats are all out looking for Waldo. An interesting effort at centered composition, though it still need something. The whole thing seems to come together in an X-shape. You need to straighten the horizon and some additional colors adjustments might help it to pop a bit, especially with the brickwork.</td>', 'I think the boats are all out looking for Waldo. An interesting effort at centered composition, though it still need something. The whole thing seems to come together in an X-shape. You need to straighten the horizon and some additional colors adjustments might help it to pop a bit, especially with the brickwork.', '2008-05-01 14:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
