(4674072, 675056, 39430, '<td valign="top">Aww, cute.  I love Lemurs - check my FS entry from Jan.  :)  This is a good in-the-wild looking shot.</td>', 'Aww, cute.  I love Lemurs - check my FS entry from Jan.  :)  This is a good in-the-wild looking shot.', '2008-05-02 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674075, 674265, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice editing work, although it is a little dark, and the halos around the buildings are distracting.  I''d love to see more detail on the rocks to give more image for the viewer to wander around.</td>', 'Nice editing work, although it is a little dark, and the halos around the buildings are distracting.  I''d love to see more detail on the rocks to give more image for the viewer to wander around.', '2008-05-02 09:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674082, 674940, 39430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Nice leading lines, the centred horizon and almost centred tree work well for me, and the colours are just perfect.  For me, the photo actually gives the feeling of dusk, with the dim light and red/orange colouring, but I live on an east coast, so our mornings are brighter.  You must live on a west coast, or inland.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Nice leading lines, the centred horizon and almost centred tree work well for me, and the colours are just perfect.  For me, the photo actually gives the feeling of dusk, with the dim light and red/orange colouring, but I live on an east coast, so our mornings are brighter.  You must live on a west coast, or inland.', '2008-05-02 09:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674087, 674183, 39430, '<td valign="top">This shot looks a little cartoonish, with the different lighting colours, and stark lines and contrast.  It''s not really a photo of Central Park, so perhaps a different title would be better.</td>', 'This shot looks a little cartoonish, with the different lighting colours, and stark lines and contrast.  It''s not really a photo of Central Park, so perhaps a different title would be better.', '2008-05-02 09:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674089, 670380, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but doesn''t quite get there for me.  I think it''s a little dark on the car, and the vignette is too strong.  Awesome sky though!</td>', 'This is nice, but doesn''t quite get there for me.  I think it''s a little dark on the car, and the vignette is too strong.  Awesome sky though!', '2008-05-02 09:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674093, 674876, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice light trails.  Overall, the photo is a little jumbled, with too many other lights competing for attention, and taking the focus off the train.  Perhaps a darker background would help the train lights stand out.</td>', 'Nice light trails.  Overall, the photo is a little jumbled, with too many other lights competing for attention, and taking the focus off the train.  Perhaps a darker background would help the train lights stand out.', '2008-05-02 09:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674100, 674444, 39430, '<td valign="top">The storm really doesn''t stand out in this shot, so the title doesn''t fit.  With the BW, it actually looks like it was a blue sky with a polarising filter.  :)  Nice scene though, and the dark sky does help to focus the viewer onto the cottage and trees.</td>', 'The storm really doesn''t stand out in this shot, so the title doesn''t fit.  With the BW, it actually looks like it was a blue sky with a polarising filter.  :)  Nice scene though, and the dark sky does help to focus the viewer onto the cottage and trees.', '2008-05-02 09:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674109, 673755, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and leading lines, but the lines don''t lead anywhere, except away from the area of interest.</td>', 'Nice angle and leading lines, but the lines don''t lead anywhere, except away from the area of interest.', '2008-05-02 09:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674118, 674320, 39430, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to work out what this was.  It would be better if there was some more light to define his shape.  There is also a blue-cast which should be fixed in editing.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'It took me a while to work out what this was.  It would be better if there was some more light to define his shape.  There is also a blue-cast which should be fixed in editing.  Nice idea though.', '2008-05-02 09:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674125, 672822, 39430, '<td valign="top">Tricky to vote on this one.  The composition and the idea are quite nice, but the image clarity is bad, and the ''historical'' effect doesn''t do the image any favours.  It''s also slightly crooked.  Then again, the technical flaws and the overall effect do make it stand out from the crowd.</td>', 'Tricky to vote on this one.  The composition and the idea are quite nice, but the image clarity is bad, and the ''historical'' effect doesn''t do the image any favours.  It''s also slightly crooked.  Then again, the technical flaws and the overall effect do make it stand out from the crowd.', '2008-05-02 09:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674133, 674786, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows!  This has a very interesting, slightly HDR look about it, while still looking very natural.  If you know how to do dodging and burning, do it to this photo.  If you don''t know, learn, so you can do it.  If you already did, then it looks good, but do more.  :)  This image would also benefit from a slightly bolder border.  A few pixels of black would really help it stand out.</td>', 'Nice shadows!  This has a very interesting, slightly HDR look about it, while still looking very natural.  If you know how to do dodging and burning, do it to this photo.  If you don''t know, learn, so you can do it.  If you already did, then it looks good, but do more.  :)  This image would also benefit from a slightly bolder border.  A few pixels of black would really help it stand out.', '2008-05-02 09:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674157, 667102, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours in this high-key portrait.  The editing is a little rough on the background though.  Her eye whites are also a little bluish.  I would also crop just a little off the top of the image to hide the bump in her hair.  Then print it out and give her a copy.  She''ll love it.</td>', 'Nice colours in this high-key portrait.  The editing is a little rough on the background though.  Her eye whites are also a little bluish.  I would also crop just a little off the top of the image to hide the bump in her hair.  Then print it out and give her a copy.  She''ll love it.', '2008-05-02 09:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674175, 674558, 39430, '<td valign="top">This has that slightly oversaturated, too-sharp, postcard look about it.  But as a saturated sharp postcard, it''s not bad.  :)  A more prominent foreground subject would help.  Crouch down and go closer to one of those red bushes, and use that as foreground interest with the mountain backdrop.</td>', 'This has that slightly oversaturated, too-sharp, postcard look about it.  But as a saturated sharp postcard, it''s not bad.  :)  A more prominent foreground subject would help.  Crouch down and go closer to one of those red bushes, and use that as foreground interest with the mountain backdrop.', '2008-05-02 09:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674178, 674650, 39430, '<td valign="top">Lovely flowers.  I can''t help wanting to see more at the top of the image though.</td>', 'Lovely flowers.  I can''t help wanting to see more at the top of the image though.', '2008-05-02 09:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674196, 674753, 39430, '<td valign="top">Well, this image certainly stands out from the crowd.  The high contrast coloured lighting is a little bit much for me, and the composition is trying to be centred, but doesn''t quite make it with the misaligned chain.  Great setup, and certainly has promise for a fantastic image though.</td>', 'Well, this image certainly stands out from the crowd.  The high contrast coloured lighting is a little bit much for me, and the composition is trying to be centred, but doesn''t quite make it with the misaligned chain.  Great setup, and certainly has promise for a fantastic image though.', '2008-05-02 09:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674201, 673257, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  Would be nice to see the flower more front on, and not quite so close to the edge of the frame.</td>', 'Nice and simple.  Would be nice to see the flower more front on, and not quite so close to the edge of the frame.', '2008-05-02 09:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674209, 674113, 39430, '<td valign="top">There''s some wierd colours here that don''t work well for me., but an interesting subject.</td>', 'There''s some wierd colours here that don''t work well for me., but an interesting subject.', '2008-05-02 09:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674218, 670101, 39430, '<td valign="top">Would be improved if her face could fill more of the frame, and less wasted space.</td>', 'Would be improved if her face could fill more of the frame, and less wasted space.', '2008-05-02 09:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674233, 672876, 39430, '<td valign="top">She looks very grumpy, like someone threw her in there.  :)  The lighting her is a little flat - perhaps an overhead shade could help, or a reflector to reflect some nice light onto her.</td>', 'She looks very grumpy, like someone threw her in there.  :)  The lighting her is a little flat - perhaps an overhead shade could help, or a reflector to reflect some nice light onto her.', '2008-05-02 09:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674240, 674539, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice fish-eye!  Would be nicer if those great clouds could be somehow framed between the tree and the house, rather than the tree in the middle.</td>', 'Nice fish-eye!  Would be nicer if those great clouds could be somehow framed between the tree and the house, rather than the tree in the middle.', '2008-05-02 09:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674245, 674972, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the slight noise texture here.  It works well with the mood.</td>', 'I like the slight noise texture here.  It works well with the mood.', '2008-05-02 09:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674247, 674674, 58457, '<td valign="top">here is the dilemma.  While this is a photograph that I could by no means take, it does lack the punch of others in this challenge.  I respect the technical photographic ability it took to take this picture.  I guess I could just see more!  either closer up to the galaxy or crisper stars.  Nice job anyhoo.</td>', 'here is the dilemma.  While this is a photograph that I could by no means take, it does lack the punch of others in this challenge.  I respect the technical photographic ability it took to take this picture.  I guess I could just see more!  either closer up to the galaxy or crisper stars.  Nice job anyhoo.', '2008-05-02 09:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674263, 674813, 39430, '<td valign="top">Ha ha.  Hi Larus.  As usual, great work.  My constructively nit-picking criticisms are - his shorts just look slightly too much like boxer shorts, which doesn''t quite fit his character, the bricks are too square around his belly button, and maybe too many thick lines obscuring his face.  But hey, it''s still fantastic work, and a great addition to your comic-book series.</td>', 'Ha ha.  Hi Larus.  As usual, great work.  My constructively nit-picking criticisms are - his shorts just look slightly too much like boxer shorts, which doesn''t quite fit his character, the bricks are too square around his belly button, and maybe too many thick lines obscuring his face.  But hey, it''s still fantastic work, and a great addition to your comic-book series.', '2008-05-02 10:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674272, 668843, 39430, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF has just pushed some important areas of this image out of focus, so perhaps a smaller aperture would have helped.  Still, a very nice shot.</td>', 'The shallow DOF has just pushed some important areas of this image out of focus, so perhaps a smaller aperture would have helped.  Still, a very nice shot.', '2008-05-02 10:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674280, 674856, 39430, '<td valign="top">A cliche image, but this is well done.  Some contrast enhancements would help this image really pop.</td>', 'A cliche image, but this is well done.  Some contrast enhancements would help this image really pop.', '2008-05-02 10:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674329, 667439, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interestingly decrepit, and I like the slight diagonal of the field and the rows of vegetation between the clay mud and the house like a sort of living fence.  Might like more intense green to highlight the difference between the live young greenery and the aging house, and a touch more contrast and sharpness.</td>', 'Interestingly decrepit, and I like the slight diagonal of the field and the rows of vegetation between the clay mud and the house like a sort of living fence.  Might like more intense green to highlight the difference between the live young greenery and the aging house, and a touch more contrast and sharpness.', '2008-05-02 10:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674331, 674891, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but the end result is a bit dark to me.  I love the spread of the wing feathers.</td>', 'Great capture, but the end result is a bit dark to me.  I love the spread of the wing feathers.', '2008-05-02 10:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674332, 674645, 39430, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  What an amazing expression for a lion.  Great editing work too.  This image would be even more striking with the full 720 pixels.</td>', 'Lovely.  What an amazing expression for a lion.  Great editing work too.  This image would be even more striking with the full 720 pixels.', '2008-05-02 10:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674334, 670625, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s more eyeball than I usually see =:-O  Glad you chose B&amp;W for this!</td>', 'That''s more eyeball than I usually see =:-O  Glad you chose B&W for this!', '2008-05-02 10:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674335, 672354, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love how his little crest is windblown.  Looks rather rakish ;-)  Nice detail on the handsome little guy.</td>', 'I love how his little crest is windblown.  Looks rather rakish ;-)  Nice detail on the handsome little guy.', '2008-05-02 10:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674337, 673338, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective; it looks inviting.</td>', 'Nice perspective; it looks inviting.', '2008-05-02 10:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674339, 670337, 39430, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus and perhaps a different crop.  The negative space is good, but perhaps a tighter crop on the sides?</td>', 'Sharper focus and perhaps a different crop.  The negative space is good, but perhaps a tighter crop on the sides?', '2008-05-02 10:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674341, 672707, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great colors and I love the matching blue on the dish and the butterfly.  Nice detail, too.</td>', 'Great colors and I love the matching blue on the dish and the butterfly.  Nice detail, too.', '2008-05-02 10:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674343, 674796, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot, but the subject is a little self obscured.</td>', 'Nice crisp shot, but the subject is a little self obscured.', '2008-05-02 10:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674346, 673228, 39430, '<td valign="top">Crisp focus would really help this image.  I like the colours against the white fence.</td>', 'Crisp focus would really help this image.  I like the colours against the white fence.', '2008-05-02 10:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674347, 674785, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty kitty; lots of detail in the fur and the spotlight sort of effect suits him/her.  I think I would crop out much of the dark areas on the right and bottom to create a natural vignette, too.</td>', 'Pretty kitty; lots of detail in the fur and the spotlight sort of effect suits him/her.  I think I would crop out much of the dark areas on the right and bottom to create a natural vignette, too.', '2008-05-02 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674350, 675038, 65234, '<td valign="top">They look about half an inch away from the ground with their elbows.  Scary.</td>', 'They look about half an inch away from the ground with their elbows.  Scary.', '2008-05-02 10:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674351, 674139, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what the title means, but I like the classic BW artistic character and composition of the image.  There are some distracting details, like the lamp-posts in the background.</td>', 'I don''t know what the title means, but I like the classic BW artistic character and composition of the image.  There are some distracting details, like the lamp-posts in the background.', '2008-05-02 10:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674352, 674767, 16793, '<td valign="top">Love you POV..Great image</td>', 'Love you POV..Great image', '2008-05-02 10:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674354, 674425, 39430, '<td valign="top">This image certainly has a lot of character, and the title really puts it in a context, and triggers the meaning in the image.  Great example of a title turning a good image into a great image.</td>', 'This image certainly has a lot of character, and the title really puts it in a context, and triggers the meaning in the image.  Great example of a title turning a good image into a great image.', '2008-05-02 10:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674356, 670261, 39430, '<td valign="top">Lovely BW composition.  Simple, elegant, and great use of leading lines.  I can''t help feeling that a slightly tilted crop would add just a little extra punch.</td>', 'Lovely BW composition.  Simple, elegant, and great use of leading lines.  I can''t help feeling that a slightly tilted crop would add just a little extra punch.', '2008-05-02 10:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674360, 674517, 39430, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect image.  What a pity we can''t see the birds face just a little more clearly.  Nice lighting and editing.</td>', 'Almost perfect image.  What a pity we can''t see the birds face just a little more clearly.  Nice lighting and editing.', '2008-05-02 10:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674363, 671789, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely setting with the stained glass window in the back, and her veil is quite pretty in that light. I like the overall composition.  She looks a little crowded in the corner with that poof of blue from her dress and no space netween her and the frame on the right, and the window isn''t level horizontally which is blatant to me because the horizontal lines in the window are pointing to her face (though I''m guessing if you fix that it won''t be vertically level on the left, so you''d need to adjust the crop).</td>', 'Lovely setting with the stained glass window in the back, and her veil is quite pretty in that light. I like the overall composition.  She looks a little crowded in the corner with that poof of blue from her dress and no space netween her and the frame on the right, and the window isn''t level horizontally which is blatant to me because the horizontal lines in the window are pointing to her face (though I''m guessing if you fix that it won''t be vertically level on the left, so you''d need to adjust the crop).', '2008-05-02 10:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674365, 674566, 65234, '<td valign="top">Covered in pollen, as is everything here this time of year!  Very nice colors/tones.</td>', 'Covered in pollen, as is everything here this time of year!  Very nice colors/tones.', '2008-05-02 10:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674367, 667236, 39430, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little flat for a studio shot.  Try some more directional lighting.</td>', 'The lighting is a little flat for a studio shot.  Try some more directional lighting.', '2008-05-02 10:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674373, 674405, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with lovely subdued colours.  Focus is pretty good, but a little wider DOF would probably help to get consistent focus across the whole subject.</td>', 'Nice shot with lovely subdued colours.  Focus is pretty good, but a little wider DOF would probably help to get consistent focus across the whole subject.', '2008-05-02 10:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4674400, 671147, 65234, '<td valign="top">The delicacy of the leaves is very pretty, but the brightness of the background ones makes it hard to see the foreground ones as clearly as I''d like.</td>', 'The delicacy of the leaves is very pretty, but the brightness of the background ones makes it hard to see the foreground ones as clearly as I''d like.', '2008-05-02 10:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
