(4674420, 666492, 7786, '<td valign="top">This image has a goods and bads. The composition is nice and its well exposed. The bad things is the sharpening. It think you used too large radius when you sharpened it because there is an halo around the crane and because the image isnt that sharp. To make it sharper without getting halo I recomend using USM with radius of 0.3-0.4 and strength around 100-200.</td>', 'This image has a goods and bads. The composition is nice and its well exposed. The bad things is the sharpening. It think you used too large radius when you sharpened it because there is an halo around the crane and because the image isnt that sharp. To make it sharper without getting halo I recomend using USM with radius of 0.3-0.4 and strength around 100-200.', '2008-05-02 10:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
