(4674438, 670268, 7786, '<td valign="top">An supersharp image with stunning colors. On the down side the leaf on the left that overlaps the frog is distracting as it causes blur on the left leg. I think if you went a little to the left you would have eliminated this problem. If possible a smaller aperature would have made a deeper DOF which would have made the frog more interesting as more of it would be in focus.</td>', 'An supersharp image with stunning colors. On the down side the leaf on the left that overlaps the frog is distracting as it causes blur on the left leg. I think if you went a little to the left you would have eliminated this problem. If possible a smaller aperature would have made a deeper DOF which would have made the frog more interesting as more of it would be in focus.', '2008-05-02 11:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
