(4676083, 673673, 91496, '<td valign="top">Lovely pose and capture.  I might have cropped it below the elbow as it kind of stands apart from the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Lovely pose and capture.  I might have cropped it below the elbow as it kind of stands apart from the rest of the photo.', '2008-05-02 23:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
