(4676096, 674985, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The 2nd and the 3rd subject are kind of distracting.  I wonder if a close up crop of the middle third would have had more impact.</td>', 'Nice photo.  The 2nd and the 3rd subject are kind of distracting.  I wonder if a close up crop of the middle third would have had more impact.', '2008-05-02 23:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676097, 674170, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a good thing people can''t lick their noses. seems like a snapshot, but good for what it is.</td>', 'It''s a good thing people can''t lick their noses. seems like a snapshot, but good for what it is.', '2008-05-02 23:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676101, 674780, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the b/w works with me for this particular shot. I wonder what the color version looks like. It is good, just not for me personally.</td>', 'I''m not sure the b/w works with me for this particular shot. I wonder what the color version looks like. It is good, just not for me personally.', '2008-05-02 23:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676104, 674966, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This stands out from all the other photos I have looked at so far..  Lovely focus and beautifaul rich greens contrasted wiht the stark white.</td>', 'Wow.  This stands out from all the other photos I have looked at so far..  Lovely focus and beautifaul rich greens contrasted wiht the stark white.', '2008-05-02 23:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676109, 675065, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a snapshot here, I''m afraid.  Colors are a little dull, some minor adjustments could help give this a little pop.</td>', 'Seems a snapshot here, I''m afraid.  Colors are a little dull, some minor adjustments could help give this a little pop.', '2008-05-02 23:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676110, 673261, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 7/7/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:8/6 <br/>Presentation: 6 <br/>Total: 6.4 <br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: The somber tonalities are discernibly retained and this de- and refines the whites, the precipitation as well as the wash. The frail, bent railing stemming vs. onslaught of elements appears as surreal as a ladder on flat ground. The proportions, in this images, are well assigned by the camera angle. Given the violence of wave and weather,  it''s reassuring to find the weight where it belongs, at the bottom, while having enough head-room. :)</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 7/7/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/6 Aesthetics/Technical:8/6 Presentation: 6 Total: 6.4 Vote: 6  Remarks: The somber tonalities are discernibly retained and this de- and refines the whites, the precipitation as well as the wash. The frail, bent railing stemming vs. onslaught of elements appears as surreal as a ladder on flat ground. The proportions, in this images, are well assigned by the camera angle. Given the violence of wave and weather,  it''s reassuring to find the weight where it belongs, at the bottom, while having enough head-room. :)', '2008-05-02 23:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676112, 674519, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a lot of baby shots here on DPC, but this one really nails it with a clear shot, wonderful details and an interesting pose. Not that a kid will intentionally pose for you at this age. How many tries did it take to get this?</td>', 'I''ve seen a lot of baby shots here on DPC, but this one really nails it with a clear shot, wonderful details and an interesting pose. Not that a kid will intentionally pose for you at this age. How many tries did it take to get this?', '2008-05-02 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676113, 674869, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  The upper third of the right rainbow looks a little unnatural for some reason, which is a little distracting.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  The upper third of the right rainbow looks a little unnatural for some reason, which is a little distracting.', '2008-05-02 23:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676119, 674479, 91496, '<td valign="top">Soft and feminine photo.  Title is a little wordy.  "Rodeo Queen"  would have sufficed and made me look for the horse in the BG.</td>', 'Soft and feminine photo.  Title is a little wordy.  "Rodeo Queen"  would have sufficed and made me look for the horse in the BG.', '2008-05-02 23:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676128, 674517, 91496, '<td valign="top">While the preeening is an interesting pose, it is a little awkward from a composition perpective.  The necks leads away and then back to the body, which lead the viewer in a cicle rather than a clear direction.</td>', 'While the preeening is an interesting pose, it is a little awkward from a composition perpective.  The necks leads away and then back to the body, which lead the viewer in a cicle rather than a clear direction.', '2008-05-02 23:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676131, 673565, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of this little guy. I wish it was one that grabbed me, but it''s still pretty good.</td>', 'Nice catch of this little guy. I wish it was one that grabbed me, but it''s still pretty good.', '2008-05-02 23:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
