(4676136, 674617, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The two side Elk making the "frame" are a little oodly placed.  Maybe cropping in on just the center Elf would have had more wow.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The two side Elk making the "frame" are a little oodly placed.  Maybe cropping in on just the center Elf would have had more wow.', '2008-05-02 23:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
