(4676157, 674746, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the photo, but can not get past tha the upper hand not cupping the sun properly.  It seem to be the central theme of the photo, so...  <br/>I love the shadow effects.</td>', 'Love the photo, but can not get past tha the upper hand not cupping the sun properly.  It seem to be the central theme of the photo, so...  I love the shadow effects.', '2008-05-02 23:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
