(4676162, 673394, 91496, '<td valign="top">Top bird deserves a 10.  The other 3 drag the photo down somewhat.  Crop to top bird may not have worked but might have been worth trying.</td>', 'Top bird deserves a 10.  The other 3 drag the photo down somewhat.  Crop to top bird may not have worked but might have been worth trying.', '2008-05-02 23:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
