(4676186, 672513, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is pretty interesting. A lot for the eye to explore, but not too busy. The yellow shirt makes it. The boy would be lost in the frame if he was not wearing that bold color.</td>', 'This is pretty interesting. A lot for the eye to explore, but not too busy. The yellow shirt makes it. The boy would be lost in the frame if he was not wearing that bold color.', '2008-05-03 00:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
