(4676194, 675072, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, with rich color contrasts.  Clouds are a little unnaturatl looking.  Title is a little confusing and wordy, and I did not see the relationship to the photo.</td>', 'Nice photo, with rich color contrasts.  Clouds are a little unnaturatl looking.  Title is a little confusing and wordy, and I did not see the relationship to the photo.', '2008-05-03 00:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
