(4676237, 674717, 83313, '<td valign="top">Will Lurch greet me at the door?</td>', 'Will Lurch greet me at the door?', '2008-05-03 00:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4676244, 665636, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bold colors, but the whole image seems fairly soft. I think there is a lot of JPEG compression going on here that is robbing you of some detail. Your file size of 79k when you could have used up to 200k bears this out. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.<br/> <br/>Also, I think it is acceptable to clone out phone wires under advanced editing rules, so you could get rid of that distraction with a bit of editing.</td>', 'Bold colors, but the whole image seems fairly soft. I think there is a lot of JPEG compression going on here that is robbing you of some detail. Your file size of 79k when you could have used up to 200k bears this out. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over. Also, I think it is acceptable to clone out phone wires under advanced editing rules, so you could get rid of that distraction with a bit of editing.', '2008-05-03 00:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
