(4679360, 672426, 87808, '<td valign="top">nicely tack sharp, great colours, interesting sad subject, well done<br/> <br/>Edited to add, <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>This is where titles are important, in this shot, the bird is looking out of the cage.  If the title had read "A Bird" then the cage shouldnt have been in the shot.  But becuase of the title, we now know that the cage is a major element in this shot.  This shot is here to evoke a feeling of sadness, caged up feeling, wanting to free. you have depicted it very well adn I hope that people look at this and realise what you where going for.</td>', 'nicely tack sharp, great colours, interesting sad subject, well done Edited to add,    This is where titles are important, in this shot, the bird is looking out of the cage.  If the title had read "A Bird" then the cage shouldnt have been in the shot.  But becuase of the title, we now know that the cage is a major element in this shot.  This shot is here to evoke a feeling of sadness, caged up feeling, wanting to free. you have depicted it very well adn I hope that people look at this and realise what you where going for.', '2008-05-04 15:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
