(4679692, 674467, 32872, '<td valign="top">Really cute Lizard...I only wish you had cleaned-up the specks in the foreground.  I like your use of diagonal lines, it works well here. imho</td>', 'Really cute Lizard...I only wish you had cleaned-up the specks in the foreground.  I like your use of diagonal lines, it works well here. imho', '2008-05-04 18:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679695, 673574, 61818, '<td valign="top">Something disconcerting going on with the right cheek in the frame, it almost looks like it is reflecting hair or was accidentally whacked with the clone tool while the skin was being worked on.  Nice shot.   Decent job on the skin, little too much on the eyes.  No attention appears to have been paid to all the stray hairs surrounding the head.  Focus is nice.</td>', 'Something disconcerting going on with the right cheek in the frame, it almost looks like it is reflecting hair or was accidentally whacked with the clone tool while the skin was being worked on.  Nice shot.   Decent job on the skin, little too much on the eyes.  No attention appears to have been paid to all the stray hairs surrounding the head.  Focus is nice.', '2008-05-04 18:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679699, 674674, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like how you had the galaxies pose.  Also you did a great job lighting this.</td>', 'I like how you had the galaxies pose.  Also you did a great job lighting this.', '2008-05-04 18:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679702, 674519, 32872, '<td valign="top">Adorable and timeless.  One can get lost in a baby''s eyes, especially this beautiful baby.  I love the diamonds in the eyes.  Nice lighting and soft detail.</td>', 'Adorable and timeless.  One can get lost in a baby''s eyes, especially this beautiful baby.  I love the diamonds in the eyes.  Nice lighting and soft detail.', '2008-05-04 18:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679706, 674997, 32872, '<td valign="top">What a looker!  Love his whiskers and the pretty green background.</td>', 'What a looker!  Love his whiskers and the pretty green background.', '2008-05-04 18:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679708, 674858, 32872, '<td valign="top">Ahh what a sweetheart.  She has beautiful eyes and a sweet smile that you''ve captured very well.  I love your DOF and b/w.</td>', 'Ahh what a sweetheart.  She has beautiful eyes and a sweet smile that you''ve captured very well.  I love your DOF and b/w.', '2008-05-04 18:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679711, 674539, 32872, '<td valign="top">Whoa Nellie...makes me a bit dizzy, but the detail and colors are pretty!</td>', 'Whoa Nellie...makes me a bit dizzy, but the detail and colors are pretty!', '2008-05-04 18:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679713, 674909, 32872, '<td valign="top">I''m always amazed at the different species of deer.  She''s accessing the danger before she bolts!</td>', 'I''m always amazed at the different species of deer.  She''s accessing the danger before she bolts!', '2008-05-04 18:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679714, 674768, 32872, '<td valign="top">A beautiful child and image! Lovely.</td>', 'A beautiful child and image! Lovely.', '2008-05-04 18:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679716, 667169, 55838, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh!!  What luck!(?)  Great timing!  : )</td>', 'Oh my gosh!!  What luck!(?)  Great timing!  : )', '2008-05-04 18:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679717, 674707, 32872, '<td valign="top">Sweet image and title!  I love the training wheels and the feeling of determination.</td>', 'Sweet image and title!  I love the training wheels and the feeling of determination.', '2008-05-04 18:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679719, 674963, 32872, '<td valign="top">Cool textures..must be a ship of some sort.</td>', 'Cool textures..must be a ship of some sort.', '2008-05-04 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679722, 674501, 32872, '<td valign="top">Interesting image!  Looks like a spider found a new home or would that be an old home? I like the angle you shot this....with the lid open.  Good idea.</td>', 'Interesting image!  Looks like a spider found a new home or would that be an old home? I like the angle you shot this....with the lid open.  Good idea.', '2008-05-04 18:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679726, 674824, 32872, '<td valign="top">Most interesting candid..takes a while to figure out what''s going on.  I like it!</td>', 'Most interesting candid..takes a while to figure out what''s going on.  I like it!', '2008-05-04 18:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679728, 675060, 32872, '<td valign="top">What a pretty abstract!</td>', 'What a pretty abstract!', '2008-05-04 18:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679729, 672513, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great refelctions.  It almost feels like he is floating.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great refelctions.  It almost feels like he is floating.  Very nice.', '2008-05-04 18:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679731, 675039, 32872, '<td valign="top">Perfect title!  Nice image of everyday objects.  I like your use of duotone and dof.</td>', 'Perfect title!  Nice image of everyday objects.  I like your use of duotone and dof.', '2008-05-04 18:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679732, 674866, 55838, '<td valign="top">What a great freaky dream sort of feel here.  Cool light and colors.</td>', 'What a great freaky dream sort of feel here.  Cool light and colors.', '2008-05-04 18:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679733, 674790, 32872, '<td valign="top">What a cool looking image...strangely quiet and void of life...except for the little ducks at the bottom!  I love your detail and amazing lighting.</td>', 'What a cool looking image...strangely quiet and void of life...except for the little ducks at the bottom!  I love your detail and amazing lighting.', '2008-05-04 18:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679736, 675065, 32872, '<td valign="top">Great look of concentration on his face.  Nice DOF and bokeh, but I wish there were more detail, imho.</td>', 'Great look of concentration on his face.  Nice DOF and bokeh, but I wish there were more detail, imho.', '2008-05-04 18:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679737, 674744, 32872, '<td valign="top">Love the vibrant colors.</td>', 'Love the vibrant colors.', '2008-05-04 18:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679742, 674175, 32872, '<td valign="top">OMG...no way.  What a unique site to see from where I''m living!  It''s not everyday one has an iceburg in their frontyard.  Look at how white and smooth that ice is?!  Are you in New Zealand?</td>', 'OMG...no way.  What a unique site to see from where I''m living!  It''s not everyday one has an iceburg in their frontyard.  Look at how white and smooth that ice is?!  Are you in New Zealand?', '2008-05-04 18:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679746, 674784, 32872, '<td valign="top">Love the drop of water on the end of his bill!  Pretty blue colors.</td>', 'Love the drop of water on the end of his bill!  Pretty blue colors.', '2008-05-04 18:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679751, 674838, 32872, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture and nice DOF.  Pink is her color, btw!! :)</td>', 'Beautiful capture and nice DOF.  Pink is her color, btw!! :)', '2008-05-04 18:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679752, 674759, 32872, '<td valign="top">These guys eat their shar of mosquitoes!  I love seeing them swoop and soar.</td>', 'These guys eat their shar of mosquitoes!  I love seeing them swoop and soar.', '2008-05-04 18:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679758, 674942, 32872, '<td valign="top">OMG!  Adorable and precious beyond words.  You captured a winner here on more than one level! imho...I think this wonderful image would benefit from having the top part cropped out to the middle of the flower...just my opinion.</td>', 'OMG!  Adorable and precious beyond words.  You captured a winner here on more than one level! imho...I think this wonderful image would benefit from having the top part cropped out to the middle of the flower...just my opinion.', '2008-05-04 18:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679759, 673849, 55838, '<td valign="top">A very nice environmental portrait.  Cool lighting and so sweet. 8</td>', 'A very nice environmental portrait.  Cool lighting and so sweet. 8', '2008-05-04 18:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679762, 674877, 32872, '<td valign="top">Stunning night scene!  I love the smoothness of the ocean and warm colors.</td>', 'Stunning night scene!  I love the smoothness of the ocean and warm colors.', '2008-05-04 18:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679766, 668060, 61818, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2008-05-04 18:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679779, 674427, 55838, '<td valign="top">Yup, it''s all fun-n-games until someone gets a Hippie in the eye!  : )  Nice colors, interesting subjects, and good processing here. 7</td>', 'Yup, it''s all fun-n-games until someone gets a Hippie in the eye!  : )  Nice colors, interesting subjects, and good processing here. 7', '2008-05-04 18:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679783, 668060, 55838, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.   I like the tilt and the textures of the back work well.  My eyes would like a tad sharper focus on the subjects face.</td>', 'Nice portrait.   I like the tilt and the textures of the back work well.  My eyes would like a tad sharper focus on the subjects face.', '2008-05-04 18:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679787, 674639, 55838, '<td valign="top">And a magnificant heap it is too!  : )  Interesting/unusual landscape with nice tones.</td>', 'And a magnificant heap it is too!  : )  Interesting/unusual landscape with nice tones.', '2008-05-04 18:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679793, 674951, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition.  I love the little queen.  My eyes would prefer that she were centered (crop a little off the right).  Nice different capture. 8</td>', 'Very cool composition.  I love the little queen.  My eyes would prefer that she were centered (crop a little off the right).  Nice different capture. 8', '2008-05-04 18:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679795, 674702, 55838, '<td valign="top">I like the funky processing here.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'I like the funky processing here.  Interesting shot.', '2008-05-04 19:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679823, 670607, 77838, '<td valign="top">This feels like a really tight crop of a larger image.  Maybe to help retain a little more detail would be to lower your ISO setting or try to get closer to the subject.  Interesting selective desaturation too. -BB</td>', 'This feels like a really tight crop of a larger image.  Maybe to help retain a little more detail would be to lower your ISO setting or try to get closer to the subject.  Interesting selective desaturation too. -BB', '2008-05-04 19:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679826, 674625, 77838, '<td valign="top">Awesome image.  The focus seems a little too soft for me but the overall feeling is very good though. Cool pose + pretty girl = great entry! -BB</td>', 'Awesome image.  The focus seems a little too soft for me but the overall feeling is very good though. Cool pose + pretty girl = great entry! -BB', '2008-05-04 19:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679870, 674405, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a great bird shot. Nice, crisp, clean. Good composition and lighting as well. Nothing in the background to detract from your subject. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What a great bird shot. Nice, crisp, clean. Good composition and lighting as well. Nothing in the background to detract from your subject. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-05-04 20:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679874, 674798, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the hat and tight close up. Some of the highlights seem a bit blown or a little on the high yellow side, but otherwise nicely done.</td>', 'I like the hat and tight close up. Some of the highlights seem a bit blown or a little on the high yellow side, but otherwise nicely done.', '2008-05-04 20:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679876, 674245, 41675, '<td valign="top">That is a cool shadow of the fly. To be honest I didn''t notice until I read your title. Good macro.</td>', 'That is a cool shadow of the fly. To be honest I didn''t notice until I read your title. Good macro.', '2008-05-04 20:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679879, 674142, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great image. I like the colors and composition and how the footprints lead toward the person. A little bit of noise, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Great image. I like the colors and composition and how the footprints lead toward the person. A little bit of noise, but still a nice shot.', '2008-05-04 20:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679881, 674877, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good cityscape. It seems maybe a trifle blurred to me especially on the left hand side, but again, a nice image. I didn''t know San diego was so pretty at night.</td>', 'Good cityscape. It seems maybe a trifle blurred to me especially on the left hand side, but again, a nice image. I didn''t know San diego was so pretty at night.', '2008-05-04 20:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679883, 674050, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Your image makes me smile. I get the sense the boy is mimicking the man in his walk. This would have also fit the "Tell a story" challenge.</td>', ':-) Your image makes me smile. I get the sense the boy is mimicking the man in his walk. This would have also fit the "Tell a story" challenge.', '2008-05-04 20:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679885, 675043, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not a bad aquarium shot. A bit busy with all the sharks and some of the highlights detract, but not bad.</td>', 'Not a bad aquarium shot. A bit busy with all the sharks and some of the highlights detract, but not bad.', '2008-05-04 20:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679886, 674467, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - good title. I like the angle of your composition and the lighting.</td>', 'Lol - good title. I like the angle of your composition and the lighting.', '2008-05-04 20:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679887, 674627, 41675, '<td valign="top">My first impression was Hansel and Gretyl without Hansel. To me, your image has a fairy tale quality, but perhaps a bit over sharpened.</td>', 'My first impression was Hansel and Gretyl without Hansel. To me, your image has a fairy tale quality, but perhaps a bit over sharpened.', '2008-05-04 20:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679889, 674517, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good capture. I like the lighting, composition and colors. Nothing in the background to detract from your subject either. Well done.</td>', 'Good capture. I like the lighting, composition and colors. Nothing in the background to detract from your subject either. Well done.', '2008-05-04 20:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679891, 674784, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. I also like the blurred ships in the background to give it that harbor feel.</td>', 'Nice close up. I also like the blurred ships in the background to give it that harbor feel.', '2008-05-04 20:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679893, 674639, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. Your post-processing gives me a vintage photo feel. I like the foreground colors. The sky seems a little funky as it''s more black &amp; white-ish, but a good image overall.</td>', 'Nice landscape. Your post-processing gives me a vintage photo feel. I like the foreground colors. The sky seems a little funky as it''s more black & white-ish, but a good image overall.', '2008-05-04 20:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679896, 673718, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. For me, the colors are so soft they seem a bit washed out.</td>', 'I like the lighting. For me, the colors are so soft they seem a bit washed out.', '2008-05-04 20:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679898, 674645, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good tonal values. The eyes draw me in so the bits of background aren''t too disruptive.</td>', 'Good tonal values. The eyes draw me in so the bits of background aren''t too disruptive.', '2008-05-04 20:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679901, 674968, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute little hunter-in-training portrait. Good lighting and I like the expression you captured. Well done!</td>', 'Cute little hunter-in-training portrait. Good lighting and I like the expression you captured. Well done!', '2008-05-04 20:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679908, 673660, 41675, '<td valign="top">The eyes are cool. Having everything else blown out makes it a bit spooky...and interesting.</td>', 'The eyes are cool. Having everything else blown out makes it a bit spooky...and interesting.', '2008-05-04 20:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679912, 672266, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - it takes three men on the ground and one on a horse to milk a cow? ;-) Just teasing. Nice shot. The rope leads my eyes from the rider to the ones on the ground and to the cow.</td>', 'Lol - it takes three men on the ground and one on a horse to milk a cow? ;-) Just teasing. Nice shot. The rope leads my eyes from the rider to the ones on the ground and to the cow.', '2008-05-04 20:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679914, 672303, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice bW horse portrait. Good lighting and composition as well.</td>', 'Nice bW horse portrait. Good lighting and composition as well.', '2008-05-04 20:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679919, 674130, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice image of the hawk. I''d be curious to see the entire color version as well.</td>', 'Nice image of the hawk. I''d be curious to see the entire color version as well.', '2008-05-04 20:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679922, 674847, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - fun photo. I like the contrasting colors of their clothes with the snow. Good capture.</td>', 'Lol - fun photo. I like the contrasting colors of their clothes with the snow. Good capture.', '2008-05-04 20:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679929, 673008, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the background seems a little too flat for the rest of the image. Perhaps if it were white instead of gray? Interesting flower. I like the maroon color contrast to the green of the leaves.</td>', 'For me, the background seems a little too flat for the rest of the image. Perhaps if it were white instead of gray? Interesting flower. I like the maroon color contrast to the green of the leaves.', '2008-05-04 20:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679933, 675054, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice image with the sun. A bit of noise on the F-18, but good composition.</td>', 'Nice image with the sun. A bit of noise on the F-18, but good composition.', '2008-05-04 20:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679936, 674997, 41675, '<td valign="top">What great browns! They contrast nicely with the green background. Great lighting too. Nicely done and best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What great browns! They contrast nicely with the green background. Great lighting too. Nicely done and best of luck in the challenge.', '2008-05-04 20:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679938, 672003, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the blurred blue structure in the background is a bit distracting, but I like her expression and the tree.</td>', 'For me, the blurred blue structure in the background is a bit distracting, but I like her expression and the tree.', '2008-05-04 20:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679942, 667169, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - now that''s a first. I don''t recall ever seeing someone capture a goose going to the bathroom in mid-air. I also like the placement of the feet of the one behind. Hah, ha, ha.</td>', 'Lol - now that''s a first. I don''t recall ever seeing someone capture a goose going to the bathroom in mid-air. I also like the placement of the feet of the one behind. Hah, ha, ha.', '2008-05-04 20:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679943, 669355, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice black &amp; white. Good contrast and composition.</td>', 'Nice black & white. Good contrast and composition.', '2008-05-04 20:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679945, 667664, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the white diagonal in the background is distracting, but the lighting on the critter is good as well as the off-centered composition.</td>', 'For me, the white diagonal in the background is distracting, but the lighting on the critter is good as well as the off-centered composition.', '2008-05-04 20:25:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4679947, 669979, 41675, '<td valign="top">The way you captured the flower it has a nice, soft inner glow. It makes me think of a softly lit lamp.</td>', 'The way you captured the flower it has a nice, soft inner glow. It makes me think of a softly lit lamp.', '2008-05-04 20:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4679951, 674937, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute photo. The window reflections are a bit distracting and the lighting is a bit on the yellow-ish side, but I like his expression.</td>', 'Cute photo. The window reflections are a bit distracting and the lighting is a bit on the yellow-ish side, but I like his expression.', '2008-05-04 20:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680017, 674135, 77838, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W combined with the bold borders really give this image a strong powerful feeling.  I like your point of view here as it feels like you are down in the surf taking this photo. -BB</td>', 'B&W combined with the bold borders really give this image a strong powerful feeling.  I like your point of view here as it feels like you are down in the surf taking this photo. -BB', '2008-05-04 21:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680024, 670387, 77838, '<td valign="top">Your model is very beautiful. I like that her face is sharp and clear but having her hand on her chin gives this a unique feeling. Excellent shot. -BB</td>', 'Your model is very beautiful. I like that her face is sharp and clear but having her hand on her chin gives this a unique feeling. Excellent shot. -BB', '2008-05-04 21:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680072, 673234, 9462, '<td valign="top">I like this much better than the negative... and I really liked the negative.</td>', 'I like this much better than the negative... and I really liked the negative.', '2008-05-04 21:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680081, 674055, 9462, '<td valign="top">Hah!</td>', 'Hah!', '2008-05-04 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680175, 674943, 65107, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, almost like a movie special effect</td>', 'Very dramatic, almost like a movie special effect', '2008-05-04 22:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680186, 674818, 83313, '<td valign="top">some decent street photography, It''s just not my personal taste. I find my eye drawn mor eto the man on the left than to the the couple that are actually the subjects.</td>', 'some decent street photography, It''s just not my personal taste. I find my eye drawn mor eto the man on the left than to the the couple that are actually the subjects.', '2008-05-04 23:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680194, 675001, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool looking mist. The whole image seems very dark however, and I know my monitor is adjusted a touch light if anything. I wonder if you could have brightened up the rest of the image without killing that wonderful fog.</td>', 'Cool looking mist. The whole image seems very dark however, and I know my monitor is adjusted a touch light if anything. I wonder if you could have brightened up the rest of the image without killing that wonderful fog.', '2008-05-04 23:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680197, 674982, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cute, but I''m afraid this comes off as a snapshot. Severely backlit, and some distracting elements of the background cut right through the middle of his head.</td>', 'Cute, but I''m afraid this comes off as a snapshot. Severely backlit, and some distracting elements of the background cut right through the middle of his head.', '2008-05-04 23:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680200, 675068, 65107, '<td valign="top">very expressive fun photo.  What could make it better? Slightly off center is odd, but that creates a certain tension/distraction.  Minor comment, shade of green could be prettier. Slight angle of the pipe, maybe a bigger angle for the while picture would add to the fun.</td>', 'very expressive fun photo.  What could make it better? Slightly off center is odd, but that creates a certain tension/distraction.  Minor comment, shade of green could be prettier. Slight angle of the pipe, maybe a bigger angle for the while picture would add to the fun.', '2008-05-04 23:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680201, 674605, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very neat looking. the blown out high key appearance of the rails works for this, giving it a very surrealistic look.</td>', 'Very neat looking. the blown out high key appearance of the rails works for this, giving it a very surrealistic look.', '2008-05-04 23:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680202, 674909, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good wildlife shot. I wonder if anything could have made the deer standout from the backgorund a little more. Of course, nature designed it to blend in.</td>', 'Good wildlife shot. I wonder if anything could have made the deer standout from the backgorund a little more. Of course, nature designed it to blend in.', '2008-05-04 23:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680204, 675038, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ah, the awesome combo of a huge zoom lens and a ticket for a good seat!</td>', 'Ah, the awesome combo of a huge zoom lens and a ticket for a good seat!', '2008-05-04 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680212, 674962, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, though I personally find a little too much of a golden cast in it.</td>', 'Nice, though I personally find a little too much of a golden cast in it.', '2008-05-04 23:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680216, 674506, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lots of nice details and I like the strong but subtle pastel colors.</td>', 'Lots of nice details and I like the strong but subtle pastel colors.', '2008-05-04 23:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680217, 674339, 65107, '<td valign="top">There is a rule of thumb about the horizon in this case applicable to the waters edge.  It should not be in the middle but rather mostly water or mostly trees.  the middle of the frame is kind of empty.  I find myself looking hard at the small bush before I consider the more interesting large trees that are perhaps too far off to either left or right.  Maybe just one tree and more refelction.</td>', 'There is a rule of thumb about the horizon in this case applicable to the waters edge.  It should not be in the middle but rather mostly water or mostly trees.  the middle of the frame is kind of empty.  I find myself looking hard at the small bush before I consider the more interesting large trees that are perhaps too far off to either left or right.  Maybe just one tree and more refelction.', '2008-05-04 23:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
