(4680809, 672892, 58452, '<td valign="top">Her expression makes me wonder what she''s listening to. The composition is nice, but my eye is constantly attracted to the large black band on the left and top. I''d have composed so to eliminate the chair, the bands, and maybe make the framed textile more of the composition.  But those are just nit pics and personal preferences. I like what you''ve accomplished with this image.  Congrats.</td>', 'Her expression makes me wonder what she''s listening to. The composition is nice, but my eye is constantly attracted to the large black band on the left and top. I''d have composed so to eliminate the chair, the bands, and maybe make the framed textile more of the composition.  But those are just nit pics and personal preferences. I like what you''ve accomplished with this image.  Congrats.', '2008-05-05 02:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4680810, 674154, 674, '<td valign="top">sorry the editing has made this look like one of those shots where a film camera has let in the light on the side.</td>', 'sorry the editing has made this look like one of those shots where a film camera has let in the light on the side.', '2008-05-05 02:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
