(4681522, 674753, 81530, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and lighting in this photograph, but the green hair is very disruptive because it stands out the most.</td>', 'I really like the composition and lighting in this photograph, but the green hair is very disruptive because it stands out the most.', '2008-05-05 11:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681562, 674539, 65234, '<td valign="top">THAT lawn looks like a bear to mow ;-)  Fun perspective.</td>', 'THAT lawn looks like a bear to mow ;-)  Fun perspective.', '2008-05-05 11:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681564, 674479, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like it could be used as an ad for anything wholesome.</td>', 'Looks like it could be used as an ad for anything wholesome.', '2008-05-05 11:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681566, 674517, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice curves.</td>', 'Nice curves.', '2008-05-05 11:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681571, 674170, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aww :-)  Did you mean for the background to be askew?  The red door makes it pretty noticeable.  Being only somewhat askew almost always looks accidental to me.</td>', 'Aww :-)  Did you mean for the background to be askew?  The red door makes it pretty noticeable.  Being only somewhat askew almost always looks accidental to me.', '2008-05-05 11:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681575, 674617, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice looking beast.  I think I would have cropped down to a head and neck portrait-type shot.  Not entirely fond of the OOF elk bits in the foreground as I think they detract from the majestic look of the subject.</td>', 'Nice looking beast.  I think I would have cropped down to a head and neck portrait-type shot.  Not entirely fond of the OOF elk bits in the foreground as I think they detract from the majestic look of the subject.', '2008-05-05 11:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681584, 674930, 65234, '<td valign="top">Colors are nice.  Her expression seems a bit strained and the free-flying cloth is cut off rather abruptly, both of which detract from the happy sort of feeling I would expect to get from this kind of shot.  But then I don''t think a pregnant woman ever feels totally free, inhabited by another being as she is, particularly at that stage where the being is making him/herself known via kicks, stretches, hiccups and the like.</td>', 'Colors are nice.  Her expression seems a bit strained and the free-flying cloth is cut off rather abruptly, both of which detract from the happy sort of feeling I would expect to get from this kind of shot.  But then I don''t think a pregnant woman ever feels totally free, inhabited by another being as she is, particularly at that stage where the being is making him/herself known via kicks, stretches, hiccups and the like.', '2008-05-05 11:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681589, 673951, 65234, '<td valign="top">Unless there''s an island out there I think that pot of gold belongs to the sea creatures.</td>', 'Unless there''s an island out there I think that pot of gold belongs to the sea creatures.', '2008-05-05 11:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681593, 674696, 65234, '<td valign="top">That looks like a mouth she''s lying in!  Cool fish.</td>', 'That looks like a mouth she''s lying in!  Cool fish.', '2008-05-05 11:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681603, 674870, 65234, '<td valign="top">But where are all the people?  Strange sight for an Easter morning, but nice leading lines, and I like the shadows on the doors and the contrast between the bright white church and the cracked weedy sidewalk.</td>', 'But where are all the people?  Strange sight for an Easter morning, but nice leading lines, and I like the shadows on the doors and the contrast between the bright white church and the cracked weedy sidewalk.', '2008-05-05 11:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681610, 674881, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like Bee Balm.  Nice structure to the bud and I like the hints of flowers in the corners showing what it will become.</td>', 'Looks like Bee Balm.  Nice structure to the bud and I like the hints of flowers in the corners showing what it will become.', '2008-05-05 11:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681625, 673294, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is making me dizzy!  Fun way to portray spring flowers.</td>', 'This is making me dizzy!  Fun way to portray spring flowers.', '2008-05-05 11:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681633, 671860, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, it''s a cute face!  Light is a bit harsh; I''d try bouncing or softening the flash (a tissue works to soften it if you can''t bounce it).</td>', 'Oh, it''s a cute face!  Light is a bit harsh; I''d try bouncing or softening the flash (a tissue works to soften it if you can''t bounce it).', '2008-05-05 11:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
