(4681760, 672003, 42379, '<td valign="top">She is a very engaging model, draws you into the picture...  I like the casual look with her hand on her head and leaning back on to the branch.  Good bokeh in the background as well.  Not sure if the foreground branch adds or subtracts from the shot however, I keep staring at it to try to decide and I can''t make up my mind on that!</td>', 'She is a very engaging model, draws you into the picture...  I like the casual look with her hand on her head and leaning back on to the branch.  Good bokeh in the background as well.  Not sure if the foreground branch adds or subtracts from the shot however, I keep staring at it to try to decide and I can''t make up my mind on that!', '2008-05-05 12:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681761, 672514, 42379, '<td valign="top">I would love to learn how to do this type of image!  Very good!</td>', 'I would love to learn how to do this type of image!  Very good!', '2008-05-05 12:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681765, 672717, 42379, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but something about too much white... Her left shoulder she leanes her cheek on is kind of washed out on my monitor, along with her arm and side/back.  Maybe a contrasting background would work better so the white shirt would stand out more.  Her shadow on the left side of the picture works to give this contrast needed, which is about the depth of contrast I am suggesting.</td>', 'I really like this shot, but something about too much white... Her left shoulder she leanes her cheek on is kind of washed out on my monitor, along with her arm and side/back.  Maybe a contrasting background would work better so the white shirt would stand out more.  Her shadow on the left side of the picture works to give this contrast needed, which is about the depth of contrast I am suggesting.', '2008-05-05 12:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681771, 674971, 42379, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but maybe find a way to get just the rocks and not all the scrubby brush on top of it in the shot.  Different angle perhaps?  Battleships are so immense, having the scrubby bush interferring with much of the central ship takes away from the battleship too much.</td>', 'I like the idea, but maybe find a way to get just the rocks and not all the scrubby brush on top of it in the shot.  Different angle perhaps?  Battleships are so immense, having the scrubby bush interferring with much of the central ship takes away from the battleship too much.', '2008-05-05 12:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681777, 674943, 42379, '<td valign="top">Blue Angels are great photo ops... I like the coloring/editing you did to this.</td>', 'Blue Angels are great photo ops... I like the coloring/editing you did to this.', '2008-05-05 12:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681780, 672549, 42495, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is just stunning.</td>', 'The lighting on this is just stunning.', '2008-05-05 12:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
