(4681787, 668492, 42495, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely stunning photo.  I love how they''re holdings hands and looking down together; these shared moments do make for great memories.  I sure hope you know these people and that they get a copy of this.  My favorite of the challenge so far.</td>', 'This is an absolutely stunning photo.  I love how they''re holdings hands and looking down together; these shared moments do make for great memories.  I sure hope you know these people and that they get a copy of this.  My favorite of the challenge so far.', '2008-05-05 12:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
