(4681978, 669775, 83313, '<td valign="top">This seems very soft and grainy. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 87k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)</td>', 'This seems very soft and grainy. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 87k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)', '2008-05-05 14:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4681981, 674291, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the message is in this shot. Perhaps the disregard for authority is the point?</td>', 'Not sure what the message is in this shot. Perhaps the disregard for authority is the point?', '2008-05-05 14:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
