(4683218, 674842, 25890, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there. It''s almost impossible to take a bad picture at that place. Candidly speaking, it''s not a spectacular photograph, in my opinion. But it''s satisfactory enough. I think what bothers me is the somewhat haphazard composition. Too evenly divided into two distinct photographs, if you will, and the elements on the upper and lower halves seem entirely disconnected from each other, and thus fail to form a coherent whole, despite the presence of the reflections which create a symmetry.</td>', 'I''ve been there. It''s almost impossible to take a bad picture at that place. Candidly speaking, it''s not a spectacular photograph, in my opinion. But it''s satisfactory enough. I think what bothers me is the somewhat haphazard composition. Too evenly divided into two distinct photographs, if you will, and the elements on the upper and lower halves seem entirely disconnected from each other, and thus fail to form a coherent whole, despite the presence of the reflections which create a symmetry.', '2008-05-06 00:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
