(4683960, 669001, 674, '<td valign="top">nice contrast</td>', 'nice contrast', '2008-05-06 10:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683963, 674659, 39430, '<td valign="top">For environmental portraits, I love the wide angle lenses.  With a wider lens, you can show more of the place with the person still large in the frame.  Particularly with this title, it would be great to see more of the place around this interesting lady.</td>', 'For environmental portraits, I love the wide angle lenses.  With a wider lens, you can show more of the place with the person still large in the frame.  Particularly with this title, it would be great to see more of the place around this interesting lady.', '2008-05-06 10:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683970, 670101, 674, '<td valign="top">very dark and moody</td>', 'very dark and moody', '2008-05-06 10:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683971, 674799, 39430, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of nice detail hidden in the shadows.  Perhaps some editing could bring more of this out, like the To-Let sign, and more of the people in the shadows.</td>', 'There''s a lot of nice detail hidden in the shadows.  Perhaps some editing could bring more of this out, like the To-Let sign, and more of the people in the shadows.', '2008-05-06 10:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683973, 675046, 65234, '<td valign="top">And he''s looking at you!  I never cease to be amazed by Hummingbird shots, and this is a particularly good one in color and composition.  I suspect I would have played with toning down the red in the feeder to better match the bird''s head, but then I don''t always know when to leave well enough alone ;-)</td>', 'And he''s looking at you!  I never cease to be amazed by Hummingbird shots, and this is a particularly good one in color and composition.  I suspect I would have played with toning down the red in the feeder to better match the bird''s head, but then I don''t always know when to leave well enough alone ;-)', '2008-05-06 10:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683976, 668452, 674, '<td valign="top">dont like the sepia</td>', 'dont like the sepia', '2008-05-06 10:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683982, 673234, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and lighting.  The blue/greens of the painting contrast nicely.</td>', 'Nice tones and lighting.  The blue/greens of the painting contrast nicely.', '2008-05-06 10:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683989, 674843, 674, '<td valign="top">typical mykonos all blue and white</td>', 'typical mykonos all blue and white', '2008-05-06 10:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683990, 674143, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lines.  The colours are a bit overcontrasty and solarised - very batman comic-book like.  :)  Would be nice to see a more subtle edit.</td>', 'Nice dramatic lines.  The colours are a bit overcontrasty and solarised - very batman comic-book like.  :)  Would be nice to see a more subtle edit.', '2008-05-06 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683991, 673079, 674, '<td valign="top">nice cloud shot</td>', 'nice cloud shot', '2008-05-06 10:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683993, 668524, 674, '<td valign="top">dont like the duotone</td>', 'dont like the duotone', '2008-05-06 10:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683994, 673454, 674, '<td valign="top">focus is on the chair arm</td>', 'focus is on the chair arm', '2008-05-06 10:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683995, 671769, 674, '<td valign="top">your lighthouse is falling over</td>', 'your lighthouse is falling over', '2008-05-06 10:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4683997, 673953, 39430, '<td valign="top">You don''t happen to live near <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=32345" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">alain</a> do you?  :)  He has some similar animals in his folio.  (sorry, I don''t know if it''s a fox or wolf or something else)  Some artful dodging of this image would really help to bring out the contrasts and this guy would really jump out of the screen.</td>', 'You don''t happen to live near  alain do you?  :)  He has some similar animals in his folio.  (sorry, I don''t know if it''s a fox or wolf or something else)  Some artful dodging of this image would really help to bring out the contrasts and this guy would really jump out of the screen.', '2008-05-06 10:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684006, 674536, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice hdr editing of this character.  I would prefer him a little further away from the background to reduce the flash-shadow, and perhaps his head tilted forward a little would make a more dramatic pose.  But this has a nice feel to it</td>', 'Nice hdr editing of this character.  I would prefer him a little further away from the background to reduce the flash-shadow, and perhaps his head tilted forward a little would make a more dramatic pose.  But this has a nice feel to it', '2008-05-06 10:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684008, 674956, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lots of spooky potential in this scene.  I like the lightning, the light spilling from the barn door and the white fence.  Not so fond of the sidewalk and lights and such off to the right.  I think I would crop much tighter and play with contrast and dodging and burning to really play up the idea of something in that barn responding to the lightning, with the fence as a leading line.  Just for fun :-)</td>', 'Lots of spooky potential in this scene.  I like the lightning, the light spilling from the barn door and the white fence.  Not so fond of the sidewalk and lights and such off to the right.  I think I would crop much tighter and play with contrast and dodging and burning to really play up the idea of something in that barn responding to the lightning, with the fence as a leading line.  Just for fun :-)', '2008-05-06 10:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684010, 674444, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a doozy.</td>', 'Looks like a doozy.', '2008-05-06 10:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684012, 674418, 39430, '<td valign="top">His sponsor is going to be annoyed that you cut off his hat.  :)</td>', 'His sponsor is going to be annoyed that you cut off his hat.  :)', '2008-05-06 10:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684016, 670821, 674, '<td valign="top">too much wasted space  at the bottom</td>', 'too much wasted space  at the bottom', '2008-05-06 10:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684020, 666436, 674, '<td valign="top">what a cool dereliction shot 9</td>', 'what a cool dereliction shot 9', '2008-05-06 10:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684026, 669761, 674, '<td valign="top">it dos look like someone laughing 7</td>', 'it dos look like someone laughing 7', '2008-05-06 10:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684029, 669645, 674, '<td valign="top">pity no eye contact</td>', 'pity no eye contact', '2008-05-06 10:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684030, 669775, 39430, '<td valign="top">This looks a little blurry and noisy, like a cell-phone picture or something, or maybe a severe crop of a much larger image?  A simple colourful image like this will rely on really good technicals to stand above the crowd, and this doesn''t quite make it, which is a pity.</td>', 'This looks a little blurry and noisy, like a cell-phone picture or something, or maybe a severe crop of a much larger image?  A simple colourful image like this will rely on really good technicals to stand above the crowd, and this doesn''t quite make it, which is a pity.', '2008-05-06 10:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684035, 673511, 39430, '<td valign="top">Some lightening is needed in the editing here to bring out the details of the face.  The one in the background looks rather eerie - like a ghost twin.  :)</td>', 'Some lightening is needed in the editing here to bring out the details of the face.  The one in the background looks rather eerie - like a ghost twin.  :)', '2008-05-06 10:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684039, 675032, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice BW tones.  Some of the detail is blurred, perhaps from too-strong noise reduction?</td>', 'Nice BW tones.  Some of the detail is blurred, perhaps from too-strong noise reduction?', '2008-05-06 10:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684046, 674501, 39430, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to work out what this is.  From the title, I was trying to make it into a sink.  Nice colours, and nice use of photoshop light-painting.</td>', 'It took me a while to work out what this is.  From the title, I was trying to make it into a sink.  Nice colours, and nice use of photoshop light-painting.', '2008-05-06 10:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684050, 674862, 39430, '<td valign="top">With the strong colours throughout this image, and not much real distinction between oranges and greens, the tree doesn''t really stand out as the subject.</td>', 'With the strong colours throughout this image, and not much real distinction between oranges and greens, the tree doesn''t really stand out as the subject.', '2008-05-06 10:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684051, 666222, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the title is referring too.  As a portrait image, it would be nice to see her eyes.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the title is referring too.  As a portrait image, it would be nice to see her eyes.', '2008-05-06 10:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684055, 674785, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp focus.  Interesting choice of crop.  I would probably have tended toward cropping off the shadow area, but this does give it a very different feel.</td>', 'Nice crisp focus.  Interesting choice of crop.  I would probably have tended toward cropping off the shadow area, but this does give it a very different feel.', '2008-05-06 10:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4684057, 674766, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting shadows in the sky there.  Must be a lot of dust to get these.</td>', 'Interesting shadows in the sky there.  Must be a lot of dust to get these.', '2008-05-06 10:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
