(4684924, 666641, 30982, '<td valign="top">A picture of a bird.  But for some reason I really like it.  It seems to me that despite this poor fellow''s circumstances, he''s rather cheerful just the same.  Very well composed, nice job of catching the snowflakes.</td>', 'A picture of a bird.  But for some reason I really like it.  It seems to me that despite this poor fellow''s circumstances, he''s rather cheerful just the same.  Very well composed, nice job of catching the snowflakes.', '2008-05-06 17:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
