(4686930, 666812, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''ll probably be the only one to say this but I think this would have been even better without the sun in the pic.  For me it''s bright and distracting.  I still love the picture tho.  Great timing.</td>', 'I''ll probably be the only one to say this but I think this would have been even better without the sun in the pic.  For me it''s bright and distracting.  I still love the picture tho.  Great timing.', '2008-05-07 11:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4686931, 675063, 67697, '<td valign="top">The high key and destat are great contrasts here.  Quite a striking photo.</td>', 'The high key and destat are great contrasts here.  Quite a striking photo.', '2008-05-07 11:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4686936, 665934, 67697, '<td valign="top">I do love the idea of the yellow warmth and color transition but for some reason, the purple does not really grab me.  It seems more out of place here.  I do like the perspective and the rays of light.</td>', 'I do love the idea of the yellow warmth and color transition but for some reason, the purple does not really grab me.  It seems more out of place here.  I do like the perspective and the rays of light.', '2008-05-07 11:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4686938, 675051, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the soft pastels.  The background nicely complements the rosy color of the buds.</td>', 'I love the soft pastels.  The background nicely complements the rosy color of the buds.', '2008-05-07 11:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4686944, 670273, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like how you used selective desat to isolate your subject.  I know that taking photos in cemetaries can look kind of busy sometimes because there are so many objects there.  This looks clean and simple.</td>', 'I like how you used selective desat to isolate your subject.  I know that taking photos in cemetaries can look kind of busy sometimes because there are so many objects there.  This looks clean and simple.', '2008-05-07 11:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4686948, 666803, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the symbolism in this.  Black and white is perfect for this.</td>', 'I like the symbolism in this.  Black and white is perfect for this.', '2008-05-07 11:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4686951, 665216, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting.  Love the hair too.</td>', 'Love the lighting.  Love the hair too.', '2008-05-07 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4686954, 675016, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love how there''s this very defined head emerging from the pile of fluff.  I like the black and white textures of the brick too.</td>', 'I love how there''s this very defined head emerging from the pile of fluff.  I like the black and white textures of the brick too.', '2008-05-07 11:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
