(4687698, 672597, 67697, '<td valign="top">The green gives off this minty fresh feeling.  I love the details and textures of the leaves.</td>', 'The green gives off this minty fresh feeling.  I love the details and textures of the leaves.', '2008-05-07 16:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4687702, 674702, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really like seeing the beads and the hands contrasting against the grey linen texture.  It''s a very simple photo subject that carries a lot of impact.</td>', 'I really like seeing the beads and the hands contrasting against the grey linen texture.  It''s a very simple photo subject that carries a lot of impact.', '2008-05-07 16:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4687704, 675046, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great catch and beautiful colors.  I love how it appears to be looking at you too.</td>', 'Great catch and beautiful colors.  I love how it appears to be looking at you too.', '2008-05-07 16:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4687706, 674336, 67697, '<td valign="top">This has a beautiful painting like feel to it.  It''s fun to see the seals in front and then the beatiful sky in the background.  I love how the one seal is posing for you too.  Gorgeous reflection in the water as well.</td>', 'This has a beautiful painting like feel to it.  It''s fun to see the seals in front and then the beatiful sky in the background.  I love how the one seal is posing for you too.  Gorgeous reflection in the water as well.', '2008-05-07 16:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
