(4688761, 673528, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little soft, and I''m afraid the crop doesn''t seem right to me. I do like the nice clouds you caught across the sun.</td>', 'A little soft, and I''m afraid the crop doesn''t seem right to me. I do like the nice clouds you caught across the sun.', '2008-05-07 23:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
