(4688767, 673888, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Nice comp and great details in her shawl. Wonder what she is looking at?</td>', 'I really like this. Nice comp and great details in her shawl. Wonder what she is looking at?', '2008-05-07 23:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
