(4689277, 674753, 39427, '<td valign="top">personal best and top 10!  congrats... i know its not a ribbon but thats tough to do in a free study, I hope this convinces you to stay in it and disregard the people that can''t look deeper - we all suffer from people of that mindset at times for sure.</td>', 'personal best and top 10!  congrats... i know its not a ribbon but thats tough to do in a free study, I hope this convinces you to stay in it and disregard the people that can''t look deeper - we all suffer from people of that mindset at times for sure.', '2008-05-08 01:11:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689279, 674059, 80904, '<td valign="top">Grats on second!</td>', 'Grats on second!', '2008-05-08 01:11:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689280, 674856, 80904, '<td valign="top">Grats on third place.</td>', 'Grats on third place.', '2008-05-08 01:12:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689283, 674697, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh I was gonna come back and comment on this too.  Beautiful!  Wonderful perspective and gorgeous reflection.  Looks like a place that must be seen.  8th place in FS eh?  Ok so how about no more complaining about how your work is not reaching the masses lol.  I think you reached them on the grand stage with this challenge.  Congrats on the top 10!</td>', 'Ahhhh I was gonna come back and comment on this too.  Beautiful!  Wonderful perspective and gorgeous reflection.  Looks like a place that must be seen.  8th place in FS eh?  Ok so how about no more complaining about how your work is not reaching the masses lol.  I think you reached them on the grand stage with this challenge.  Congrats on the top 10!', '2008-05-08 01:13:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689287, 674697, 8891, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous relections and scene, Deb! Big congrats on your top 10 finish!</td>', 'Gorgeous relections and scene, Deb! Big congrats on your top 10 finish!', '2008-05-08 01:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689288, 674753, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, it didn''t ribbon, but I think coming in at #7 in a freestudy should convince you that your stuff is appreciated. I read your very interesting comments that go along with this. Even if something is not personally appealing to some, it is still possible for many to identify if it is a good photo or not. (Hope that was not my comment you quoted, but that does not sound like me!)</td>', 'Well, it didn''t ribbon, but I think coming in at #7 in a freestudy should convince you that your stuff is appreciated. I read your very interesting comments that go along with this. Even if something is not personally appealing to some, it is still possible for many to identify if it is a good photo or not. (Hope that was not my comment you quoted, but that does not sound like me!)', '2008-05-08 01:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689293, 670964, 42135, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful picture!  Congrats on your top 20!!!</td>', 'What a beautiful picture!  Congrats on your top 20!!!', '2008-05-08 01:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689297, 674135, 42013, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Back with a <strike>bang</strike> <b>roar</b>! <i>edited so it didn''t look like I was copying Deb''s comment. ;)</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-08 01:03:06.</i></td>', 'Congrats! Back with a bang roar! edited so it didn''t look like I was copying Deb''s comment. ;)', '2008-05-08 01:18:23.000000', '2008-05-08 02:03:06.000000', 0),
