(4689308, 674716, 39427, '<td valign="top">congrats on the top 20, I love how deliberate the composition and framing is here, nice attention to detail</td>', 'congrats on the top 20, I love how deliberate the composition and framing is here, nice attention to detail', '2008-05-08 01:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689309, 674248, 67697, '<td valign="top">I stared at this for a bit during the challenge and all I could think was "aye, I wish I was young again."  Damn them flexible kids!  :)  But then I was also thinking how it''s a shame that they make young girls dress these days for performance routines.  This applies all the way up thru college.  Guess I''m old fashioned.  Interesting piece!</td>', 'I stared at this for a bit during the challenge and all I could think was "aye, I wish I was young again."  Damn them flexible kids!  :)  But then I was also thinking how it''s a shame that they make young girls dress these days for performance routines.  This applies all the way up thru college.  Guess I''m old fashioned.  Interesting piece!', '2008-05-08 01:22:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689310, 674551, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Like the colour, sharpness and the blured background.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Like the colour, sharpness and the blured background.', '2008-05-08 01:22:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689311, 673140, 39427, '<td valign="top">i''m surprised this wasn''t top 10 but still congrats 22/466 is awesome, i gave this a 9, really enjoyed it</td>', 'i''m surprised this wasn''t top 10 but still congrats 22/466 is awesome, i gave this a 9, really enjoyed it', '2008-05-08 01:23:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689313, 674804, 23430, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Great composition.</td>', 'Cool shot. Great composition.', '2008-05-08 01:23:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689314, 674881, 67697, '<td valign="top">If you had bug butt in this photo, it would have scored WAY HIGHER hehe.  Now that I''ve really had a chance to think about this, I think the only thing I would have done different is crop off the top to get rid of the red.  The red in the right corner isn''t in a good spot to add to the photo.  The leaf you have focused on looks wonderful and I''m thinking the red detracted from that.<br/> <br/>But bug butt would have fixed all these issues :D</td>', 'If you had bug butt in this photo, it would have scored WAY HIGHER hehe.  Now that I''ve really had a chance to think about this, I think the only thing I would have done different is crop off the top to get rid of the red.  The red in the right corner isn''t in a good spot to add to the photo.  The leaf you have focused on looks wonderful and I''m thinking the red detracted from that. But bug butt would have fixed all these issues :D', '2008-05-08 01:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4689315, 674164, 67723, '<td valign="top">yes this is a very dark moody shot. Your like the ruler of dark moody shots.</td>', 'yes this is a very dark moody shot. Your like the ruler of dark moody shots.', '2008-05-08 01:24:24.000000', NULL, 0),
