(4689360, 671761, 83313, '<td valign="top">This didn''t come up for me in voting. Nice view. I was out taking some panoramas of Dallas myself last weekend. There is a park on Sylvan Ave that affords a nice view from the north, without much junk in the way. I''m curious exactly where you shot this one from, though I can identify the general area. I might like to try that location for myself sometime.<br/> <br/>You were a little too heavy with the JPEG compression, however. The file size is only 84k, when you had up to 200k to use. I can see some artifacts around the tops of Renaissance tower and the Band of America bldg.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-08 00:47:22.</i></td>', 'This didn''t come up for me in voting. Nice view. I was out taking some panoramas of Dallas myself last weekend. There is a park on Sylvan Ave that affords a nice view from the north, without much junk in the way. I''m curious exactly where you shot this one from, though I can identify the general area. I might like to try that location for myself sometime. You were a little too heavy with the JPEG compression, however. The file size is only 84k, when you had up to 200k to use. I can see some artifacts around the tops of Renaissance tower and the Band of America bldg.', '2008-05-08 01:42:08.000000', '2008-05-08 01:47:22.000000', 0),
