(4689599, 673090, 77287, '<td valign="top">Doh! Hall of shame.....again.<br/>My misunderstanding. I remembered images with multiple exposure action shots blended and thought that the current multiple exposure rules allowed this.<br/>I didn''t get that it was for HDR only. Shame is this would have got me a second place had my score remained at 7.4+<br/>A ribbon still eludes me. ;^)<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the really nice comments and sorry to anyone who thought it was 3 lambs.<br/> <br/>Still a shot I''m very happy with though.<br/>Should be appearing in the next issue of Northern Life Magazine (UK).<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>Bob</td>', 'Doh! Hall of shame.....again.My misunderstanding. I remembered images with multiple exposure action shots blended and thought that the current multiple exposure rules allowed this.I didn''t get that it was for HDR only. Shame is this would have got me a second place had my score remained at 7.4+A ribbon still eludes me. ;^) Thanks for all the really nice comments and sorry to anyone who thought it was 3 lambs. Still a shot I''m very happy with though.Should be appearing in the next issue of Northern Life Magazine (UK). CheersBob', '2008-05-08 04:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
