(4689652, 673140, 78196, '<td valign="top">Excellent poise and drama. Magnificent lighting and conversion. Twenty times better than the outtake. I would have preferred the shot without the dancer looking directly at the camera - I think a greater appearance of concentration would give the impression of total immersion in her art and would significantly add to the drama of the image. Great work, I hope to see more like it!</td>', 'Excellent poise and drama. Magnificent lighting and conversion. Twenty times better than the outtake. I would have preferred the shot without the dancer looking directly at the camera - I think a greater appearance of concentration would give the impression of total immersion in her art and would significantly add to the drama of the image. Great work, I hope to see more like it!', '2008-05-08 06:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
