(4689923, 674758, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dang; missed this during voting and I would have voted it high.  The vulnerable baby birds are staying together and clinging tightly to a branch in a very scary, dark new world.  Some of them will be out eating worms on the lawn in no time, while others will be some cat''s lunch.  Great image.</td>', 'Dang; missed this during voting and I would have voted it high.  The vulnerable baby birds are staying together and clinging tightly to a branch in a very scary, dark new world.  Some of them will be out eating worms on the lawn in no time, while others will be some cat''s lunch.  Great image.', '2008-05-08 10:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
