(4690189, 674570, 19936, '<td valign="top">I had higher hopes for this one but see that I did overprocess a touch.  No HDR.  That look comes from the Fill Light I used when I processed from RAW.  Hey, it did keep me at 23rd in the 2008 FSM though so I''m happy.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments and votes.</td>', 'I had higher hopes for this one but see that I did overprocess a touch.  No HDR.  That look comes from the Fill Light I used when I processed from RAW.  Hey, it did keep me at 23rd in the 2008 FSM though so I''m happy. Thanks for the comments and votes.', '2008-05-08 11:56:41.000000', NULL, 0),
