(4690212, 674059, 52115, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Great colors, Nationa Geogrphic had one like it with just red-cloth, I think Librodo has done something similar. So, there are many types of planes in the sky, too.<br/> <br/>Just my opinion, I''d like to see more symetric, one-half of the nose. Slightly rotated more to her right, to lessen the curve of the chin. But that''s just some improvements toward perfection.<br/></td>', 'Excellent! Great colors, Nationa Geogrphic had one like it with just red-cloth, I think Librodo has done something similar. So, there are many types of planes in the sky, too. Just my opinion, I''d like to see more symetric, one-half of the nose. Slightly rotated more to her right, to lessen the curve of the chin. But that''s just some improvements toward perfection.', '2008-05-08 12:07:39.000000', NULL, 0),
