(4690688, 667841, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think your colors are quite nice here, Stephen - they don''t need to be saturated more at all in my opinion.  Very crisp (maybe just a wee bit too much sharpening), very clear.  At first the centered comp doesn''t suit me, but it does grow on me after awhile.  And it does make you wonder where the heck the boats are!</td>', 'I think your colors are quite nice here, Stephen - they don''t need to be saturated more at all in my opinion.  Very crisp (maybe just a wee bit too much sharpening), very clear.  At first the centered comp doesn''t suit me, but it does grow on me after awhile.  And it does make you wonder where the heck the boats are!', '2008-05-08 16:48:04.000000', NULL, 0),
