(4690781, 674142, 30982, '<td valign="top">You know, now that I look at it a bit longer, I do recognize Andi.  When voting in the challenge, I thought the scene looked familiar but couldn''t quite put my finger on it.  And I really liked this one when voting (still do, of course).  Very good job with the editing!</td>', 'You know, now that I look at it a bit longer, I do recognize Andi.  When voting in the challenge, I thought the scene looked familiar but couldn''t quite put my finger on it.  And I really liked this one when voting (still do, of course).  Very good job with the editing!', '2008-05-08 17:20:55.000000', NULL, 0),
