(4691321, 666401, 57882, '<td valign="top">A few hours drive away, but definitely worth the trip.  The view is 10 times better than what this little window (picture) can represent.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Sherwin!   WOW!  Do you LIVE near that?  Or were you on some fabulous vacation.   If this is in your "I can shoot scenes like this any time cuz I live here" area. . .I may just have to get reeeeeallly jealous!  :)<br/> <br/>This is so beautiful! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'A few hours drive away, but definitely worth the trip.  The view is 10 times better than what this little window (picture) can represent. Originally posted by SandyP: Sherwin!   WOW!  Do you LIVE near that?  Or were you on some fabulous vacation.   If this is in your "I can shoot scenes like this any time cuz I live here" area. . .I may just have to get reeeeeallly jealous!  :) This is so beautiful! ', '2008-05-08 21:52:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4691325, 674164, 90064, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo, great contrast! awesome job!</td>', 'I really love this photo, great contrast! awesome job!', '2008-05-08 21:54:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4691352, 669761, 36382, '<td valign="top">When I very first saw this I thought that it was a lady''s head on the side with a fancy hat on.  I like it.  Pictures of American flags are common, but this is different because of the interesting shapes made by the flag.  I also really like the colors.  Great job.  I gave it 9 in the challenge.</td>', 'When I very first saw this I thought that it was a lady''s head on the side with a fancy hat on.  I like it.  Pictures of American flags are common, but this is different because of the interesting shapes made by the flag.  I also really like the colors.  Great job.  I gave it 9 in the challenge.', '2008-05-08 22:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4691359, 674135, 72670, '<td valign="top">Just spectacular!! now a fav.</td>', 'Just spectacular!! now a fav.', '2008-05-08 22:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4691420, 674135, 73564, '<td valign="top">Wow! Congrats!</td>', 'Wow! Congrats!', '2008-05-08 23:07:26.000000', NULL, 0),
