(4691746, 668268, 44877, '<td valign="top">Oh my - under six?? I gave you a nine, and can''t believe this didn''t score higher. It''s brilliant.</td>', 'Oh my - under six?? I gave you a nine, and can''t believe this didn''t score higher. It''s brilliant.', '2008-05-09 02:47:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4691774, 674878, 41337, '<td valign="top">I could stare at this all day.</td>', 'I could stare at this all day.', '2008-05-09 03:29:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4691777, 669252, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is flawless! Lighting, composition, mood and on top of that a breeze of truth that only a candid can deliver and presented in such an artistic way no less.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-09 02:35:09.</i></td>', 'Wow. This is flawless! Lighting, composition, mood and on top of that a breeze of truth that only a candid can deliver and presented in such an artistic way no less.', '2008-05-09 03:33:20.000000', '2008-05-09 03:35:09.000000', 0),
(4691792, 670587, 41337, '<td valign="top">So is this one of those shots where you just pointed your camera and hoped that others haven''t seen it a million times? Aside from it looking a tad acted everything else just comes together perfectly. I love how the rage has an invisible force, carried out like a distortion wave that permeates throughout the photo, yet the "machine" is given a physical presence by way of the cage that houses the subject. The fact that the left side of the gate seems weaker (larger gaps between the bars) heightens the success of the "blow". Fantastic shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-09 02:59:55.</i></td>', 'So is this one of those shots where you just pointed your camera and hoped that others haven''t seen it a million times? Aside from it looking a tad acted everything else just comes together perfectly. I love how the rage has an invisible force, carried out like a distortion wave that permeates throughout the photo, yet the "machine" is given a physical presence by way of the cage that houses the subject. The fact that the left side of the gate seems weaker (larger gaps between the bars) heightens the success of the "blow". Fantastic shot.', '2008-05-09 03:52:51.000000', '2008-05-09 03:59:55.000000', 0),
(4691799, 674697, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your well deserved top-ten finish, Deb! Nice view there</td>', 'Congrats on your well deserved top-ten finish, Deb! Nice view there', '2008-05-09 03:57:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4691816, 674716, 68504, '<td valign="top">Elegant and rich at the same time. The emphasis on the ribby crinkly character of the petals is stunning, but combining it with the 3D effect (a result of focus/light/careful postprocessing?), not to mention the cunning positioning of the poppies pretty much blows away the poppy and other flower competition.</td>', 'Elegant and rich at the same time. The emphasis on the ribby crinkly character of the petals is stunning, but combining it with the 3D effect (a result of focus/light/careful postprocessing?), not to mention the cunning positioning of the poppies pretty much blows away the poppy and other flower competition.', '2008-05-09 04:24:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4691835, 674458, 23478, '<td valign="top">wonderful perspective, easy to identify what it is, but a unique look at it - I really like the tonal range also.</td>', 'wonderful perspective, easy to identify what it is, but a unique look at it - I really like the tonal range also.', '2008-05-09 04:52:15.000000', NULL, 0);
