(4692437, 674059, 65858, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Lovely colors and incredibly well done DOF!  Tack sharp in just the right places.  Inspirational!<br/> <br/>In fact, I was inspired and did a sketch:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.kerpoof.com/create?view=b130w239n1225-69a276-x" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//scenes.kerpoof.com/b130w239n1225-69a276-x_tn.jpg'', strrpos(''//scenes.kerpoof.com/b130w239n1225-69a276-x_tn.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//scenes.kerpoof.com/b130w239n1225-69a276-x_tn.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Didn''t quite capture it, but oh well!  Congrats on the ribbon - well deserved!  =D</td>', 'Wow!  Lovely colors and incredibly well done DOF!  Tack sharp in just the right places.  Inspirational! In fact, I was inspired and did a sketch:   Didn''t quite capture it, but oh well!  Congrats on the ribbon - well deserved!  =D', '2008-05-09 11:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
