(4692596, 674834, 70514, '<td valign="top">I like the vibrancy of the colors and the kaliedescope (?sp) effect.</td>', 'I like the vibrancy of the colors and the kaliedescope (?sp) effect.', '2008-05-09 13:02:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4692620, 674834, 67152, '<td valign="top">Jon<br/>Excellent use of bright colors, interesting shapes and use of control of focus.  I actually think it is a very good quality image and would have given it a 7 during voting had I had time to vote.<br/> <br/>I wonder if a slightly different crop/ rotation so that flower center is oriented and centered a bit more geometrically would have raised the score. With the fact that the red ''border'' not being even and also not offset siginficantly, the photo appears a bit unbalanced.  Taking care to provide the same space around the image throughout would have given it a more polished look.  That''s my impression anyway - but like I said above - I like the image and I think it works pretty darn well!</td>', 'JonExcellent use of bright colors, interesting shapes and use of control of focus.  I actually think it is a very good quality image and would have given it a 7 during voting had I had time to vote. I wonder if a slightly different crop/ rotation so that flower center is oriented and centered a bit more geometrically would have raised the score. With the fact that the red ''border'' not being even and also not offset siginficantly, the photo appears a bit unbalanced.  Taking care to provide the same space around the image throughout would have given it a more polished look.  That''s my impression anyway - but like I said above - I like the image and I think it works pretty darn well!', '2008-05-09 13:22:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4692767, 665216, 42013, '<td valign="top">Tim-- its a great shot and I know you are proud of it(and should be). Kids are great and way more important than a score at DPC. I think it is proof of your continual improvement and learning that you are able to score so highly with ''kid'' shots. It says a lot about your technique. Had you down for a 9 with this one--in my top group. Keep em coming!</td>', 'Tim-- its a great shot and I know you are proud of it(and should be). Kids are great and way more important than a score at DPC. I think it is proof of your continual improvement and learning that you are able to score so highly with ''kid'' shots. It says a lot about your technique. Had you down for a 9 with this one--in my top group. Keep em coming!', '2008-05-09 15:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4692772, 665216, 67152, '<td valign="top">Tim<br/>Congrats on another fine portrait.  A great photo for your portrait studio/ home.</td>', 'TimCongrats on another fine portrait.  A great photo for your portrait studio/ home.', '2008-05-09 15:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4692812, 674870, 35602, '<td valign="top">So what is Wukong Beta?  Sounds interesting.  I like the wonderful green of the doors.  The entire image, though, seems too much alone for Easter Morning.  I am sure there is some significance for singling out such a lone subject for that particular morning.  It seems almost sad, to me.<br/> <br/>P.S.  I think I get it.  It shows the change in Easter today vs before.  Fewer people are going to church, and the headstones in the background indicate that there are more folks who are now gone that celebrated Easter.  A real paradox and social commentary on the state of religion today, even for the highest of holy days, Easter.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-09 14:52:28.</i></td>', 'So what is Wukong Beta?  Sounds interesting.  I like the wonderful green of the doors.  The entire image, though, seems too much alone for Easter Morning.  I am sure there is some significance for singling out such a lone subject for that particular morning.  It seems almost sad, to me. P.S.  I think I get it.  It shows the change in Easter today vs before.  Fewer people are going to church, and the headstones in the background indicate that there are more folks who are now gone that celebrated Easter.  A real paradox and social commentary on the state of religion today, even for the highest of holy days, Easter.', '2008-05-09 15:48:29.000000', '2008-05-09 15:52:28.000000', 0),
(4692833, 668268, 52500, '<td valign="top">Thanks for posting the original.  Fantastic shot!</td>', 'Thanks for posting the original.  Fantastic shot!', '2008-05-09 16:09:37.000000', NULL, 0),
