(4692983, 673204, 89764, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yospiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I see she is wearing sneakers, for sneaking up on her subject. (Were you wearing sneakers too?) <br/> <br/>Ok, I admit that was a dumb comment... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not dumb....I liked it and YES I was wearing sneakers.  She never knew I took the picture.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-09 16:45:16.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by yospiff: I see she is wearing sneakers, for sneaking up on her subject. (Were you wearing sneakers too?)  Ok, I admit that was a dumb comment...   Not dumb....I liked it and YES I was wearing sneakers.  She never knew I took the picture.', '2008-05-09 17:44:54.000000', '2008-05-09 17:45:16.000000', 0),
