(4693702, 674971, 89341, '<td valign="top">I think one problem is the slanted horizon, also the fact the top of the ship is cut off doesn''t help. I think I would like to see the whole ship. You could try lots of different angles maybe, there is nothing hugely wrong with your shot but there is just nothing that really jumps out and in free study the competition is much harder</td>', 'I think one problem is the slanted horizon, also the fact the top of the ship is cut off doesn''t help. I think I would like to see the whole ship. You could try lots of different angles maybe, there is nothing hugely wrong with your shot but there is just nothing that really jumps out and in free study the competition is much harder', '2008-05-10 05:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
