(4694310, 674716, 61651, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and capture of all that crinkly petal detail.  That oddly bent stem adds visual interest.  Congrats on your top 20!</td>', 'Lovely composition and capture of all that crinkly petal detail.  That oddly bent stem adds visual interest.  Congrats on your top 20!', '2008-05-10 22:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4694335, 674971, 61818, '<td valign="top">Yeah the tilted horizon is a shot killer for sure.  Also this was a free-study so the bar tends to get raised very, very high.  I could see this shot winning some sort of challenge like ''odd fellows'' or something that would really make the most of the duck and ship in the scene.  You should note this location for use in the future.  Also hitting it later in the day or early in the morning would provide some much nicer light to work with.</td>', 'Yeah the tilted horizon is a shot killer for sure.  Also this was a free-study so the bar tends to get raised very, very high.  I could see this shot winning some sort of challenge like ''odd fellows'' or something that would really make the most of the duck and ship in the scene.  You should note this location for use in the future.  Also hitting it later in the day or early in the morning would provide some much nicer light to work with.', '2008-05-10 23:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4694371, 674785, 61651, '<td valign="top">What a smoldering look - good warmth to the shot overall, too. Brown frame is nicely complementary.</td>', 'What a smoldering look - good warmth to the shot overall, too. Brown frame is nicely complementary.', '2008-05-10 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4694373, 665978, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like how you went all contrasty with the background.  Nicely chosen irregular composition, makes this shot an absolute standout.</td>', 'I like how you went all contrasty with the background.  Nicely chosen irregular composition, makes this shot an absolute standout.', '2008-05-10 23:51:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4694788, 673090, 554, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo.  I would have cropped out the dark area at the top.</td>', 'This is a really nice photo.  I would have cropped out the dark area at the top.', '2008-05-11 13:02:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4694829, 674672, 44877, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at your portfolio and you have an excellent eye. <br/> <br/>Regarding the blown out portion of the photo... I feel in general, yes, one should avoid that. However, In this image, which is so real and gritty, it does not detract or take away from the excellence of the portrait. <br/> <br/>If you notice, there''s a diagonal line from the top right to the bottom left, and the man is in that line. So the eye does not go to the blown out window (unless one doesn''t have an eye at all), but instead right to the face. <br/> <br/>My point for this long post - some rules are meant to be broken, and some broken rules add to the character and quality of the photo, as in this case. I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I''ve been looking at your portfolio and you have an excellent eye.  Regarding the blown out portion of the photo... I feel in general, yes, one should avoid that. However, In this image, which is so real and gritty, it does not detract or take away from the excellence of the portrait.  If you notice, there''s a diagonal line from the top right to the bottom left, and the man is in that line. So the eye does not go to the blown out window (unless one doesn''t have an eye at all), but instead right to the face.  My point for this long post - some rules are meant to be broken, and some broken rules add to the character and quality of the photo, as in this case. I gave it an 8.', '2008-05-11 13:37:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4694987, 674824, 7473, '<td valign="top">I think this is quite a good candid.  The vendor''s look is great.  I like the other expressions as well.  Well done!</td>', 'I think this is quite a good candid.  The vendor''s look is great.  I like the other expressions as well.  Well done!', '2008-05-11 17:41:44.000000', NULL, 0),
