(4695856, 674566, 67145, '<td valign="top">great shot .. love the darkness and that little bug .. i love bugs .. !! .. <br/>are you sure he was a bee ? .. he looks very different from the bees we have around here .. different legs and wings etc .. ours are very small too ..  no more than 1 cm long usually .. i hear they have bumble bees somewhere or other .. they can get to 2.1/2 cms long .. i''d love to have bumble bees where i live .. the bigger, the better .. a lot easier to photograph !!..:)</td>', 'great shot .. love the darkness and that little bug .. i love bugs .. !! .. are you sure he was a bee ? .. he looks very different from the bees we have around here .. different legs and wings etc .. ours are very small too ..  no more than 1 cm long usually .. i hear they have bumble bees somewhere or other .. they can get to 2.1/2 cms long .. i''d love to have bumble bees where i live .. the bigger, the better .. a lot easier to photograph !!..:)', '2008-05-12 02:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4696184, 674718, 68035, '<td valign="top">yaaay great finish for a free study.  Beautiful colouring and vignetting that draws you right into the heart of the shot.  Love the dof you used here</td>', 'yaaay great finish for a free study.  Beautiful colouring and vignetting that draws you right into the heart of the shot.  Love the dof you used here', '2008-05-12 06:28:36.000000', NULL, 0),
