(4697353, 674784, 30982, '<td valign="top">Score is probably based on a couple of things - the composition is a bit "heavy" - not quite on the dreaded rule of thirds, not quite a close enough closeup.  A little more room to the left might balance a bit better.  Whites are a bit blown in places - for some reason, DPC voters really don''t like their whites blown.  The shadow down the chest probably bothered some as well.  It''s a good solid shot of a bird, but not something that will "wow" the DPC voter in a Free Study.  Hope this helps!</td>', 'Score is probably based on a couple of things - the composition is a bit "heavy" - not quite on the dreaded rule of thirds, not quite a close enough closeup.  A little more room to the left might balance a bit better.  Whites are a bit blown in places - for some reason, DPC voters really don''t like their whites blown.  The shadow down the chest probably bothered some as well.  It''s a good solid shot of a bird, but not something that will "wow" the DPC voter in a Free Study.  Hope this helps!', '2008-05-12 14:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
