(4708430, 674701, 63269, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one. Everything is perfect, from the glow of the laptop, to the reflection amongst the glittering raindrops, to the faint outline of the mug in the shadows. The subtle but intense emotion you''ve captured is so powerful. I''ve been wandering through your portfolio, and have really been enjoying how many of your other photographs also share this unusual quality. Keep up the stunning work! :)</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one. Everything is perfect, from the glow of the laptop, to the reflection amongst the glittering raindrops, to the faint outline of the mug in the shadows. The subtle but intense emotion you''ve captured is so powerful. I''ve been wandering through your portfolio, and have really been enjoying how many of your other photographs also share this unusual quality. Keep up the stunning work! :)', '2008-05-17 16:32:59.000000', NULL, 0),
