(4712982, 674838, 31606, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot.  If you want to avoid getting a shadow of you in the eyes then you need to put a light source between you and your subject.  Judging from the reflection this is a natural light situation.  I would suggest getting a flash and mount it off camera on a stand with an umbrella.  This will give you a nice catch light in the eyes without anything else.  It is a very nice image and I think highly underrated IMO.  Hope the suggestion helps.</td>', 'This is an awesome shot.  If you want to avoid getting a shadow of you in the eyes then you need to put a light source between you and your subject.  Judging from the reflection this is a natural light situation.  I would suggest getting a flash and mount it off camera on a stand with an umbrella.  This will give you a nice catch light in the eyes without anything else.  It is a very nice image and I think highly underrated IMO.  Hope the suggestion helps.', '2008-05-20 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
