(4721974, 673426, 58272, '<td valign="top">I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=674" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sulamk</a> that the verticals here could be straightened by a touch. I think the perspective you have chosen to shoot from enhances the image, though I agree that it could do with a little selective work in pp to give it a bit more punch; perhaps some more contrast in the sky, and a slight colour boost on the church itself.</td>', 'I agree with  sulamk that the verticals here could be straightened by a touch. I think the perspective you have chosen to shoot from enhances the image, though I agree that it could do with a little selective work in pp to give it a bit more punch; perhaps some more contrast in the sky, and a slight colour boost on the church itself.', '2008-05-24 21:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
