(4891421, 674490, 42495, '<td valign="top">The light and b&amp;w conversion are excellent here.  What a shame that this didn''t score higher, but then again this is DPC and this isn''t typical FS material.  Trust me, I just learned my lesson a b&amp;w in a FS.  To improve I would have perhaps burned that bright area on the right just a bit, it pulls my eye from the subject.</td>', 'The light and b&w conversion are excellent here.  What a shame that this didn''t score higher, but then again this is DPC and this isn''t typical FS material.  Trust me, I just learned my lesson a b&w in a FS.  To improve I would have perhaps burned that bright area on the right just a bit, it pulls my eye from the subject.', '2008-08-16 01:12:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4900849, 675038, 57514, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rider:</b></div><hr/><i> think you were robbrd this should have scored much higher---nice work </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hey thanks - I am sure you can appreciate trying to get a sharp shot at these speeds!</td>', 'Originally posted by rider: think you were robbrd this should have scored much higher---nice work  Hey thanks - I am sure you can appreciate trying to get a sharp shot at these speeds!', '2008-08-20 17:32:16.000000', NULL, 0),
