(5006873, 670546, 30982, '<td valign="top">So do you hike and carry your tripod?  Very crisp detail here, and nice smooth ooh/ahh water in the waterfall.  Composed well to give the eye a path to follow, too.  (And for the record, I''m not a huge fan of waterfall shots but this one is rather pleasing!)</td>', 'So do you hike and carry your tripod?  Very crisp detail here, and nice smooth ooh/ahh water in the waterfall.  Composed well to give the eye a path to follow, too.  (And for the record, I''m not a huge fan of waterfall shots but this one is rather pleasing!)', '2008-10-13 15:12:11.000000', NULL, 0),
