(5160931, 667798, 56254, '<td valign="top">OMG, what a cutie!!  fantastic focus and colors ...</td>', 'OMG, what a cutie!!  fantastic focus and colors ...', '2008-12-31 18:28:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5161318, 672597, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Clarity is admirable.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Clarity is admirable.', '2008-12-31 22:12:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5161326, 674878, 61651, '<td valign="top">An intriguing, atypical still life.  A composition to learn from.</td>', 'An intriguing, atypical still life.  A composition to learn from.', '2008-12-31 22:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5168890, 674718, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is really gorgeous Michelle - nice placement of focus.</td>', 'This is really gorgeous Michelle - nice placement of focus.', '2009-01-03 23:02:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5185134, 674984, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a novel and interesting perspective!  Nicely composed, too.</td>', 'What a novel and interesting perspective!  Nicely composed, too.', '2009-01-11 15:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5216124, 675064, 34192, '<td valign="top">What I think is missing in your image is midtones.  If you look at the histogram, you have a lot of darks and a lot of lights, but not much in between.  that works, in this case, to keep people out of the image.  I pulled the image into photoshop and did a quick shadow/highlight to strengthen the midtones.  It may not be what you were after, but I think it would have scored higher with the DPC voters. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=759027" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Image</a></td>', 'What I think is missing in your image is midtones.  If you look at the histogram, you have a lot of darks and a lot of lights, but not much in between.  that works, in this case, to keep people out of the image.  I pulled the image into photoshop and did a quick shadow/highlight to strengthen the midtones.  It may not be what you were after, but I think it would have scored higher with the DPC voters. Image', '2009-01-24 09:30:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5216702, 675064, 68504, '<td valign="top">Hmn. My own images tend to be too dark;  but I think dahkota has something here, not just for DPC voters: possibly not quite midway between the two, darker than lighter, so that we can still be hit by the nice flowing compositional light lines in the foreground.  <br/></td>', 'Hmn. My own images tend to be too dark;  but I think dahkota has something here, not just for DPC voters: possibly not quite midway between the two, darker than lighter, so that we can still be hit by the nice flowing compositional light lines in the foreground.  ', '2009-01-24 16:07:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5232735, 673953, 7969, '<td valign="top">way to go colette!!<br/>You were lucky to get so close!<br/>Did you pay the money to photograph them or did you just go to the education center?<br/> <br/>Hey nice profile pic  : )</td>', 'way to go colette!!You were lucky to get so close!Did you pay the money to photograph them or did you just go to the education center? Hey nice profile pic  : )', '2009-02-01 17:00:04.000000', NULL, 0),
