(5264304, 675076, 3214, '<td valign="top">Well seen!  And cropped/processed.  Personally I would crop a wee bit more from the top to eliminate that stanchion top left, and it would pull the attention more fully onto your subject.  I think this was under-rated!</td>', 'Well seen!  And cropped/processed.  Personally I would crop a wee bit more from the top to eliminate that stanchion top left, and it would pull the attention more fully onto your subject.  I think this was under-rated!', '2009-02-19 01:09:33.000000', NULL, 0),
